## Sources of the two values

- **Version:** first `##` heading of `CHANGELOG.md` — `## 0.0.1 – unreleased`. The status word
  `unreleased` comes from the same heading. The root `package.json` reads `0.0.1` and agrees.
- **Last change:** newest entry in `.changes/` by highest task id — currently
  `.changes/P0-21-demo-connection.md` — rendered as the task id plus the task title
  `P0-21 — Match the demo connection to the design system` (`board.json` / `tasks/P0-21.md`).

The line is static in `index.html` with stable hooks (`data-preview-version`,
`data-preview-status`, `data-preview-last-change`); there is no runtime parsing and no fetch. Both
values are documented in `apps/web/preview/README.md` together with the rule that they are updated in
the same task as every preview, changelog or design-system change (demo cadence, screenshot
included).

